   "data": {
    "name": "The Mother of Echoes (Practice)",
    "description": "Test fight for The Mother of Echoes. The same three battles against the same enemies and the same rewards, with no shards needed. Health, chakra and stamina carry between battles with no refills, as in the real fight.",
    "successDescription": "The Mother Glass cracks from the root to the crown. Choose your reward.",
